{"ordinal":15971,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451876397061","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Ears_DontShoot_065fb16","source":"FortuneTeller: Однажды я услышала в ушах шум, как будто Вселенная мне что-то сказала. Оказалось, это просто сквозняк. Но знаешь, мне всё равно понравилось.","target":"FortuneTeller: Odată am auzit un vuiet în urechi, de parcă Universul îmi spunea ceva. S-a dovedit că era doar un curent de aer. Dar, știi, mie tot mi-a plăcut.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-400.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15972,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451876397060","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Ears_DontShoot_04f92a4","source":"FortuneTeller: Однажды я услышала в ушах шум, как будто Вселенная мне что-то сказала. Но я думаю, это было что-то гораздо сильнее.","target":"FortuneTeller: Odată am auzit un vuiet în urechi, de parcă Universul mi-ar fi spus ceva. Dar cred că era ceva mult mai puternic.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-400.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15973,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451876397059","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Photo_DontShoot_0ce14f1","source":"FortuneTeller: Знаешь, однажды мне сделали такое фото, что я подумала: это знак от звёзд! А потом поняла: просто свет неправильно упал.","target":"FortuneTeller: Știi, odată mi-au făcut o fotografie și am crezut că e un semn de la stele! Apoi mi-am dat seama că lumina căzuse prost.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-400.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15974,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451876397058","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Armpit_DontShoot_0ee02a9","source":"FortuneTeller: Наверное, сейчас моё нынешнее состояние может сравниться с тамошним.","target":"FortuneTeller: Poate că starea mea de acum se poate compara cu cea de atunci.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-400.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15975,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451876397057","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Armpit_DontShoot_064fc2a","source":"FortuneTeller: Мысли материальны, и так я приближаюсь к исполнению желания. Нужно всего-то правильно его загадать.","target":"FortuneTeller: Gândurile se materializează, iar așa mă apropii de împlinirea dorinței. Trebuie doar să-mi pun dorința cum se cuvine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-400.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15976,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451876397056","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Armpit_DontShoot_0beb138","source":"FortuneTeller: Ты знаешь, однажды я три недели жила аскетично и думала только о своей мечте.","target":"FortuneTeller: Știi, odată am trăit trei săptămâni în asceză și m-am gândit numai la visul meu.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-400.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15977,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451872202762","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Eyes_DontShoot_026a05d","source":"FortuneTeller: Глаза — это врата в другой мир. Однажды у одного человека они светились, как фонари. Он сказал, что это от любви, но я думаю — от Марса.","target":"FortuneTeller: Ochii sunt porți către altă lume. Odată, ochii unui om străluceau ca niște felinare. El a spus că era din dragoste, dar eu cred că era de la Marte.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-400.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15978,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451872202761","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Hands_DontShoot_0bd3916","source":"FortuneTeller: Однажды после обряда я всю ночь вытаскивала занозы. Больно было, но знаешь что? Каждая заноза — это как урок от Вселенной. Понимаешь, да?","target":"FortuneTeller: Odată, după un ritual, am scos așchii toată noaptea. A durut, dar știi ceva? Fiecare așchie e ca o lecție de la Univers. Înțelegi, da?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-400.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15979,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451872202760","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Teeth_DontShoot_084a8e9","source":"FortuneTeller: Я ему сказала: «Всё хорошо, но твоя душа-то прогнила!» Вот и думай после этого, что важнее. Понимаешь, да?","target":"FortuneTeller: I-am spus: «Toate bune, dar sufletul tău e putred!» Acum gândește-te ce e mai important. Înțelegi, da?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-400.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15980,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451872202759","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Teeth_DontShoot_0c01b73","source":"FortuneTeller: Знаешь, однажды ко мне пришёл человек с идеальными зубами.","target":"FortuneTeller: Știi, odată a venit la mine un om cu dinți perfecți.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-400.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15981,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451872202758","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Death_0783e5e","source":"FortuneTeller: Вечный понос!","target":"FortuneTeller: Diaree veșnică!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-400.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15982,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451872202757","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Death_04f9353","source":"FortuneTeller: Убьёшь меня – будешь обречён на…","target":"FortuneTeller: Dacă mă ucizi, vei fi osândit la…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-400.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15983,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451872202756","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Ears_Gun_0ef8a3b","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15984,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451872202755","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Ears_Gun_0c2c286","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15985,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451872202754","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Ears_Gun_095428f","source":"FortuneTeller: Может, опустишь эту штуку? Ну что ты по ушам поймёшь? Они нужны для того, чтобы слушать мудрых людей!","target":"FortuneTeller: Poate cobori chestia aia? Ce poți afla din urechi? Sunt făcute ca să-i asculți pe oamenii înțelepți!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-400.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15986,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451872202753","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Photo_Gun_083b217","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15987,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451872202752","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Photo_Gun_0c4261f","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15988,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451868008458","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Photo_Gun_071c251","source":"FortuneTeller: Эй! Я ж не виновата, что ты к такому не готов, голубчик!","target":"FortuneTeller: Hei! Nu-i vina mea că nu ești pregătit pentru asta, dragule!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-400.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15989,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451868008457","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Armpit_Gun_0585526","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15990,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451868008456","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Armpit_Gun_00c5a11","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15991,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451868008455","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Armpit_Gun_0109393","source":"FortuneTeller: Это уже не астрология, а какая-то дичь! Давай-ка ты уберёшь ружьё, а я тебе ещё расскажу своих тайн. Бесплатно!","target":"FortuneTeller: Asta nu mai e astrologie, e de-a dreptul o nebunie! Pune pușca deoparte și îți mai spun din secretele mele. Gratis!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-400.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15992,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451868008454","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Eyes_Gun_057d5d8","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15993,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451868008453","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Eyes_Gun_00c74a3","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15994,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451868008452","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Eyes_Gun_00e0c43","source":"FortuneTeller: Ты что?! Это ж просто Луна шалит, понимаешь, да?","target":"FortuneTeller: Ce faci?! E doar Luna care se joacă, înțelegi, da?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-400.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15995,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451868008451","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Eyes_Gun_0581aea","source":"FortuneTeller: Ты что?! Это ж просто Луна шалит, понимаешь, да? За её движениями не так просто уследить!","target":"FortuneTeller: Ce faci?! E doar Luna care se joacă, înțelegi, da? Nu-i așa de ușor să-i urmărești mișcările!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-400.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15996,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451868008450","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Hands_Gun_0881bdb","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15997,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451868008449","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Hands_Gun_00426c2","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15998,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451868008448","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Hands_Gun_01f99ea","source":"FortuneTeller: Ты что, серьёзно? За руки с занозами стрелять будешь? Это последствия работы с ловцами снов!","target":"FortuneTeller: Vorbești serios? O să mă împuști pentru niște așchii în mâini? Sunt de la lucrul cu prinzătoarele de vise!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-400.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15999,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451863814154","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Teeth_Gun_0effb5d","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16000,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451863814153","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Teeth_Gun_0860e44","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16001,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451863814152","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Teeth_Gun_0467191","source":"FortuneTeller: Ты что, из-за зубов в меня стрелять собрался? Ты же понимаешь, что это не из-за меня? Это Марс обиделся на Венеру.","target":"FortuneTeller: Vrei să mă împuști din cauza dinților? Înțelegi că nu e vina mea? Marte s-a supărat pe Venus.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-400.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16002,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451863814151","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:FortuneTeller_Ears_006a955","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
